  "vulnerability_information": "I'm not the best at finding \"why\" this happened, but I am pretty sure it's not supposed to.\nI was keyword searching \"protonmail invite\" and this came up even though the user was not on public nor did i follow him. I go to twitter.com and search for the exact same tweet, nothing comes up of his tweet.\nI logged into a different tweetdeck account - I can still see the tweet by searching for it, the user is on private and I do not follow him.",
